      "position": 1,
      "source_unit_type": "stage-summary",
      "text_projection": "5. 面试那天，确实没有问什么很难的，把你当做应届生看待",
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "stage-summary",
      "text_projection": "6. 先是自我介绍，然后他问挺多简历有关的问题，还有技术的应用场景，也有难一些的，但后面看我没怎么回答上来说算了算了",
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "stage-summary",
      "text_projection": "7. 大概就是问简历上的还有一些扩展的",
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "8. 之后就是问你了，薪资要求，你要问他什么问题",
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_fragment_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u4:f1",
          "order": 1,
          "fragment_type": "interviewer-cue",
          "text_projection": "薪资要求"
        },
        {
          "source_fragment_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u4:f2",
          "order": 2,
          "fragment_type": "interviewer-cue",
          "text_projection": "你要问他什么问题"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "stage-summary",
      "text_projection": "9. 这一环节我回答的不好，我就是按照简历上的薪资说，只问了他工作内容，他看我没什么东西问他还很高兴，面试时间 30 ~ 40 分钟，他说两到三天出结果",
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:656861da000000000f024258:recovered-r2:note-desc:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "10. 总结：面试失败了，问的一些问题基本上我都答上来了，有几个问题没有回答上来，也有表现不好的地方，失败了还是有点心情不好的，Java 工作好难找[叹气R][叹气R][叹气R]",
